<div n="3">             <head><hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">eod.</hi></hi><lb/>
<hi rendition="#g">Den</hi> 19. <hi rendition="#g">April</hi>.</head>             <lb/>
<p><hi rendition="#g">Anton Brown</hi>, Lord <hi rendition="#g">Vicomte Montagu</hi><lb/>
Groß-Mei&#x017F;ter.</p>             <lb/>
<p>               <hi rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#aq">v.</hi> Con&#x017F;tit. Buch S. 277 f.</hi>             </p>           </div>           <lb/>
<div n="3">             <head><hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">eod.</hi></hi><lb/>
<hi rendition="#g">Den 2. Ma&#x0364;rz</hi>.</head>             <lb/>
<p>Die <hi rendition="#g">Steward&#x2019;s</hi> in London erhalten das Recht,<lb/>
