<div n="3">             <head>1733.<lb/>
<hi rendition="#g">Den</hi> 27. <hi rendition="#g">April</hi>.</head>             <lb/>
<p>Bulle des Pab&#x017F;t <hi rendition="#g">Clemens</hi> <hi rendition="#aq">XII. &#x201E;In emi-<lb/>
