<div n="3">             <head><hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">eod.</hi></hi><lb/>
<hi rendition="#g">Den 3. Ma&#x0364;rz</hi>.</head>             <lb/>
<p>Die Papiere des B. <hi rendition="#g">Ander&#x017F;on</hi> zur neuen<lb/>
